### Calc SUBTOTAL

#### SUBTOTAL(9, range) sums the range

- Verify: SUBTOTAL(9, range) sums the range
   - Expected: _disp(sh, "Z1") equals `6`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 9 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: SUBTOTAL(9, range) sums the range")
var sh = Sheet.new("f")
sh.set_value("A1", "1")
sh.set_value("A2", "2")
sh.set_value("A3", "3")
sh.set_value("Z1", "=SUBTOTAL(9,A1:A3)")
sh = recalculate_formula_cells(sh)
expect(_disp(sh, "Z1")).to_equal("6")
```

</details>

